# Vue frontend

`apps/web` is the only UI application. Build screens from Vue single-file components, the router in `src/router/index.ts`, Pinia stores, and TanStack Query.

- Put reusable primitives in `src/components/ui/` using the existing shadcn-vue, Reka UI, and `class-variance-authority` pattern.
- Put feature components beside the current dashboard components. Keep route screens in `src/views/`.
- Call the API through `src/lib/api.ts` and the Hono client typed by `AppType`. Parse responses with `@velora/contracts`.
- Read session state from `src/stores/session.ts`. The router guard is a convenience. The API still authorizes every request.
- Style with Tailwind utilities and the semantic colors in `src/styles/globals.css`. Visual rules are in the design-system rule.
- Import the `cn` helper from `cn`. Alias `@` to `src`.
- Keep the QueryClient defaults unless the task is caching behavior: no refetch on window focus, and no automatic retry.
- Register a new route on the existing shell. Authenticated routes stay out of public indexes.

The live stylesheet still uses the stock shadcn neutral palette. Brand tokens are specified in `docs/design/tokens.css` and are not wired into the app yet.
